WEBVTT

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.681
Wow. Wow.

00:03:30.681 --> 00:03:33.600
That's a significant number of us.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.132
You know better than anyone

00:03:36.132 --> 00:03:38.399
that HIV brings out

00:03:38.399 --> 00:03:41.982
the best and the worst in humanity.

00:03:41.982 --> 00:03:44.702
And the laws reflect these attitudes.

00:03:44.702 --> 00:03:47.382
I'm not just talking about laws on the books,

00:03:47.382 --> 00:03:50.749
but laws as they are enforced on the streets

00:03:50.749 --> 00:03:53.682
and laws as they are decided in the courts.

00:03:53.682 --> 00:03:56.232
And I'm not just talking about laws

00:03:56.232 --> 00:03:58.601
as they relate to people living with HIV,

00:03:58.601 --> 00:04:01.832
but people who are at greatest risk of infection --